ApproveSale_Exits_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the sale token is zero
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the caller is not the company Governor
│   └── it should revert with OnlyGovernor
├── when the sale id was already used
│   └── it should revert with SaleExists
├── when the sale token's decimals are not 6
│   └── it should revert with InvalidSaleToken
├── when a paid sale has no terms hash
│   └── it should revert with ZeroDocumentHash
├── when a zero proceeds sale has no terms hash
│   └── it should approve the sale
└── when a passed proposal approves a sale
    ├── it should record the token and the proceeds and the terms hash
    └── it should emit SaleApproved
